/* Settings */
"语言" = "Language";
"界面语言" = "App Language";
"选择后会立即切换 AoiScan 自有界面的语言。系统分享菜单、键盘和权限弹窗仍跟随 iOS 的语言设置。" = "The language of AoiScan's interface changes immediately. System share sheets, keyboards, and permission alerts continue to follow the iOS language settings.";
"拍摄" = "Capture";
"默认开启闪光灯" = "Flash On by Default";
"开启后，每次进入扫描相机都会默认使用闪光灯；仍可在拍摄页面临时关闭或重新开启。" = "When enabled, the flash starts on whenever the scanner opens. You can still turn it off or on from the camera screen.";
"扫描识别" = "Document Detection";
"书页与小文档识别" = "Book Page and Small Document Detection";
"普通纸张严格识别失败后，再尝试增强低对比度书页或彩色文档；明确识别到摊开的左右书页时，会忽略中缝并合并为一个完整裁切范围。不会降低普通扫描的识别标准。" = "If strict detection fails, AoiScan also checks low-contrast book pages and colored documents. When both pages of an open book are detected, the center seam is ignored and the pages are combined into one crop area. This does not lower the standard used for normal documents.";
"拍摄引导提示" = "Capture Guidance";
"根据纸张大小、拍摄角度、稳定程度和环境亮度给出文字提示，不显示识别框。" = "Shows text guidance based on document size, camera angle, stability, and ambient light without displaying a detection frame.";
"文字与搜索" = "Text and Search";
"自动建立文字索引" = "Automatically Index Recognized Text";
"扫描保存后在本机识别文字，用于搜索扫描件。图片和识别文字不会上传。关闭后仍可在扫描详情中手动识别。" = "Recognizes text on the device after a scan is saved so documents can be searched. Images and recognized text are not uploaded. Manual recognition remains available in scan details when this option is off.";
"为已有扫描件建立索引" = "Index Existing Scans";
"已有扫描件索引已完成" = "Existing scans have been indexed";
"正在处理 %@ / %@" = "Processing %@ / %@";
"诊断" = "Diagnostics";
"诊断日志（Session）" = "Diagnostic Sessions";
"识别日志" = "Recognition Logs";
"日志只记录识别方式、候选数量、纸张面积和失败原因，不保存扫描图片或识别出的文字内容。最多保留 250 条。" = "Logs record detection methods, candidate counts, document area, and failure reasons. Scanned images and recognized text are not stored. Up to 250 entries are retained.";
"隐私声明" = "Privacy";
"所有功能均在本机完成" = "All Features Run On Device";
"AoiScan 不连接服务器。扫描图片、文字识别、文档搜索和文件保存均在设备本地完成，不会上传扫描内容、识别文字或文件名。" = "AoiScan does not connect to a server. Scanning, text recognition, document search, and file storage are performed locally. Scanned content, recognized text, and file names are not uploaded.";
"部分中国区 iOS 设备可能在首次使用系统键盘时显示“无线数据”授权。选择“不允许”不会影响扫描、文字识别、搜索、重命名或 PDF 生成。" = "Some iOS devices in China may show a Wireless Data permission prompt when the system keyboard is used for the first time. Choosing Don't Allow does not affect scanning, text recognition, search, renaming, or PDF generation.";
"诊断日志仅保存识别流程和错误信息，不包含扫描图片或识别文字。" = "Diagnostic logs contain only processing events and error information. They do not include scanned images or recognized text.";
